[MP_AFR_mp_map_001.FullName]
Africa 1943. Villages

[MP_AFR_mp_map_001.Description]
To win, your alliance must control ALL flags on the map for several minutes or control most of them when mission timer runs out.
If both alliances control the equal number of flags when mission timer reaches zero, the side with more surviving units wins.

