[MP_KOR_001_ctf_USSRvsUSA.FullName]
Korea 1950. Samicheon River Valley

[MP_KOR_001_ctf_USSRvsUSA.Description]
Capture all the key locations on the map and hold them for the specified time. If neither team can capture all the key points, the team that holds the greater number of them wins.
If both teams have captured an equal number of key points by the end of the mission, the team with the more combat-capable units wins.

